            "review_text": "DodgeyAus\nLoxton, Australia\n533 contributions\n0\nQuite good\nJan 2023 • Friends\nI've eaten here twice, the first time by myself, the second time with my tour group. \nThe first time I had a bowl of beef tenderloin pho. Adding a few of the leaves and chilli helped it, but it really wasn't to my taste. I'll try one up north.\nThe second time I had some of their pork and shrimp spring rolls. They were very nice. \nIt's a very busy place .\nWritten January 25, 2023",
