            "review_title": "Review at Pho 2000",
            "review_text": "Jenny T\nCleator Moor, United Kingdom\n24 contributions\n0\nFast, healthy, tasty and cheap!\nAug 2022\nWe asked our guide to take us to a pho restaurant because we've enjoyed pho in the UK and he brought us here - in the footsteps of Bill Clinton. It's a bright and clean restaurant with welcoming staff. We had the well-cooked beef pho and my vegetarian daughter had vegetable fried rice. It all arrived quickly and was very tasty. Pho is the ideal choice for a family - the basic dish is simple (broth, noodles, meat) but it arrives with herbs and condiments so the more adventurous eaters can liven it up. And the bill for 4 people with drinks was amazingly reasonable.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 30, 2022",
